00:29:44.560 --> 00:29:46.690
Konon Hongjong selalu makan gukbap di luar istana.

00:29:50.600 --> 00:29:51.930
Brengsek.

00:29:52.570 --> 00:29:55.440
Tetangga itu melarikan diri tanpa membayar pajak,
